known-issues entries. Full corpus sweep (6,015 artifacts, 0 verify
errors) through the real adversarial_verify.verify_artifact entry
point — the prior attempt was guarded on a hasattr that is False and
silently measured nothing.

- 1,529 live CRITICALs; 1,160 unstamped (1,009 pre-gate, 151
